      "raw_text": "L 𝜔 for a statement 𝑢 ∈ L . A zero-knowledge proof Completeness. A prover can convince a verifier of 𝑢 ∈ 𝑢 ∈ L . Soundness. A prover cannot convince a verifier of 𝑢 ∈ if 𝑢 ∉ L Zero-knowledge. The proof does not reveal anything 𝑢 ∈ L . [ 2 − 1 𝑁 is the bit length",
